1
00:00:03,337 --> 00:00:06,407
Item 28: Your pet name for me.

2
00:00:07,574 --> 00:00:09,884
(Amy:)Time's running out on this.
You need to make a decision.

3
00:00:10,043 --> 00:00:12,253
I submitted you a notarized list.

4
00:00:12,913 --> 00:00:15,893
I'm sorry, but "Gollum"
and "FIakey" are not acceptable.

5
00:00:16,483 --> 00:00:18,723
(Sheldon:)Well, you don't like
"Princess Corncob"

6
00:00:18,886 --> 00:00:22,056
you don't like "Fester,"
you're just impossible to please.

7
00:00:22,222 --> 00:00:23,672
(Amy:)We'll come back to that one.

8
00:00:24,057 --> 00:00:25,267
(Amy:)This brings us to the final item

9
00:00:25,425 --> 00:00:27,735
(Amy:)in our annual
State of the Relationship summit.

10
00:00:27,895 --> 00:00:30,565
Item 29: Valentine's Day.

11
00:00:30,697 --> 00:00:33,737
Ohh! The worst for last.

12
00:00:34,935 --> 00:00:36,605
(Sheldon:)Classic Flakey.

13
00:00:37,571 --> 00:00:39,411
(Amy:)Before you get upset,

14
00:00:39,573 --> 00:00:41,353
(Amy:)I believe I've come up with
a way for us to celebrate

15
00:00:41,508 --> 00:00:43,078
(Amy:)the occasion that we both can enjoy.

16
00:00:43,243 --> 00:00:45,693
(Sheldon:)People usually start
a meeting with a joke,

17
00:00:45,846 --> 00:00:48,056
(Sheldon:)but you go ahead, end with one.

18
00:00:49,182 --> 00:00:51,252
(Amy:)I propose we spend a weekend

19
00:00:51,418 --> 00:00:53,228
(Amy:)at a bed-and-breakfast
in Napa Valley.

20
00:00:53,387 --> 00:00:55,927
(Sheldon:)I hate every word in that sentence.

21
00:00:57,624 --> 00:01:01,024
Including "in" "at," "we" and "a."

